      <h1 id="configuring-oadp-multiple-bsl" class="group scroll-mt-20">Configuring the {"{"}{"{"} oadp_first {"}"}{"}"} with more than one Backup Storage Location<a href="#configuring-oadp-multiple-bsl" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
      <p>Configure multiple backup storage locations (BSLs) in the Data Protection Application (DPA) to store backups across different regions or storage providers. This provides flexibility and redundancy for your backup strategy.</p>
      <p>OADP supports multiple credentials for configuring more than one BSL, so that you can specify the credentials to use with any BSL.</p>
      <h2 id="oadp-configuring-dpa-multiple-bsl_configuring-oadp-multiple-bsl" class="group scroll-mt-20">Configuring the DPA with more than one BSL<a href="#oadp-configuring-dpa-multiple-bsl_configuring-oadp-multiple-bsl" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
