      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>cloud-credentials</code></dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Specifies the name of the default <code>Secret</code> object that you created.</p></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>name: odf</code></dt>
